  displayName: Strawman
  type: Conspiracy
  text: Mainstream 'experts' say just 'eat in moderation', but what are they hiding?
    Their 'food pyramid' is a lie.
  debunkingText: "\uFFFDThis is a Strawman attack. It misrepresents the opposing
    argument (e.g., \"food pyramid\") to make it look weak and easy to attack."
  hintText: "Changes someone\u2019s real point into a weaker version, then attacks
    that version."
